date-released: 2026-10-26
version: "1.2.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://thebeat.dev/research/memory-first-docs-second/"
abstract: >-
  Which hosting platform Claude Code picks for a real app, and how it decides.
  264 runs of 11 apps under four briefs, on Opus 5 and Opus 5.5. About half the
  time the agent picks from what its model already knows, with no web search.
  When it goes online it mostly reads the docs of the host it has already chosen.
  The record holds every run, every label, the grader and the harness.
keywords:
